    },
    {
      "id": "cancellation",
      "title": "Cancellation terms",
      "status": "known",
      "body": "Fictional demo policy. For a flexible rate, cancellation is free by 23:59 Europe/Kyiv time seven calendar days before check-in. Later cancellation or a no-show has a charge of one accommodation night. A non-refundable rate has a full-stay charge for cancellation or a no-show. Ask which rate applies; do not infer it from the room. This demo has no paid rates or published room prices, so no monetary fee can be calculated. Cancellation, changes and refunds require staff review; this data reader cannot perform them."
